  m_Text: "This scene is based on the Spine example scene \nAssets/Spine Examples/Getting
    Started/1 The Spine GameObject.unity\n\nThis scene demonstrates basic usage of
    Spine with Timeflow. \nUsing Timeflow you can:\n\n - Sequence Spine skeleton
    animations \n - Each keyframe can specify looping, flipping X and Y, and more.\n\n\nSee
    the additional example scenes included"
